    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Use spatial single-embryo outcome maps to compare observed within-domain concordance of left-right identity or melanocyte conversion with an independent-cell Bernoulli model, accounting for lineage and shared exposure.";
